Oh yeah, this update is not due to a new discount!

[h1]List of changes:[/h1]
- Updated engine;
- Updated integration with the Steam SDK;
- [b]Completely updated translation into English[/b];
- Added the ability to click on the buttons "R" (restart) and "? -H" (help).

P.S. Maybe the last point is not interesting to anyone, but why not, especially since the game can soon be released on iOS and Android ¯ \ _ (ツ) _ / ¯
Next i will work on making game easier. One year after the release. Yep.
