Over the last few days the game has been updated several times. As a result of the patches had fixed different bugs:
- Fixed bugs that prevent the passage of some levels;
- Fixed errors due to which there has been no transfer between levels.
- Fixed bugs associated with the transition phrases in the dialogues;
- Fixed bug which incorrectly displayed the number of "shells";
- Fixed bugs with saving.
I received treatment associated with a very high difficulty. In my plans the development of a simplified mode, which will not be randomized difficulty, but will disable achievements. This mode will appeal to players who want to play just for the sake of the plot.
Also, soon plans to release a special game mode, which will only be opened after the passage.

